#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:4
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page takes you from a fresh checkout to training, replaying, and "
"inspecting your first task. For prerequisites, see :ref:`installation-"
"system-requirements`. Run all commands from the Isaac Lab repository root "
"with ``uv run``. ``uv`` creates and manages the project environment for you."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何从刚克隆的仓库开始，训练、运行并查看你的第一个任务。前置要求见 :ref:`installation-system-"
"requirements` 。所有命令均在 Isaac Lab 仓库根目录下通过 ``uv run`` 执行， ``uv`` 会自动创建并管理项目环境。"

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:14
msgid "Install and run your first task"
msgstr "安装并运行第一个任务"

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:16
msgid ""
"Install `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/>`__, "
"clone Isaac Lab, and enter the repository:"
msgstr ""
"安装 `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/>`__ ，克隆 "
"Isaac Lab 并进入仓库目录："

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:25
msgid ""
"Train Cartpole with the Newton MJWarp physics backend (its default, selected"
" explicitly here to show the syntax) and open the Newton visualizer:"
msgstr ""
"使用 Newton MJWarp 物理后端训练 Cartpole，并打开 Newton 可视化器。Cartpole "
"默认使用此后端，这里显式指定以展示参数写法："

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:32
msgid ""
"Training outputs, including checkpoints, are saved under ``logs/``. Add "
"``--help`` to any command to see its available arguments:"
msgstr "训练输出（包括检查点）保存在 ``logs/`` 目录下。在命令后添加 ``--help`` ，即可查看可用参数："

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:40
msgid "Configure an editor (optional)"
msgstr "配置编辑器（可选）"

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:42
msgid ""
"To enable import completion and debugging in VS Code or Cursor, generate the"
" machine-local editor configuration from the repository root:"
msgstr "要在 VS Code 或 Cursor 中使用导入补全和调试功能，请在仓库根目录下生成适用于当前机器的编辑器配置："

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:49
msgid ""
"If you use the ``isaacsim`` extra, include it so the command can discover "
"the Isaac Sim extensions:"
msgstr "如果使用 ``isaacsim`` 可选依赖组，请在命令中包含它，以便查找 Isaac Sim 扩展："

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:56
msgid ""
"VS Code uses Pylance. Cursor users should install basedpyright instead. See "
":ref:`setup-vs-code` for complete editor and troubleshooting instructions."
msgstr ""
"VS Code 使用 Pylance；Cursor 用户应安装 basedpyright。完整的编辑器配置和故障排查说明见 :ref:`setup-"
"vs-code` 。"

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:77
msgid ""
"``uv run`` installs the core dependencies automatically. To use an optional "
"integration, add ``--extra <name>`` before ``isaaclab``. You can enable "
"multiple extras with a comma-separated list. For example:"
msgstr ""
"``uv run`` 会自动安装核心依赖。要使用可选集成，请在 ``isaaclab`` 前添加 ``--extra <name>`` "
"。多个可选依赖组可以用逗号分隔。例如："

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:85
msgid ""
"Extras make optional capabilities available; task selectors choose which "
"capabilities the task uses For example, ``--extra ovphysx`` makes the OV "
"PhysX integration available, while ``physics=ovphysx`` selects it for the "
"task. You can combine extras as needed. The ``--extra all`` shortcut "
"installs the curated ``ov``, ``rl-games``, ``sb3``, ``skrl``, ``rsl-rl``, "
"``rerun``, and ``viser`` extras. Isaac Sim, standalone importers, and "
"specialized extras such as ``skrl-jax``, ``rlinf``, ``mimic``, ``teleop``, "
"``tetrahedralization``, ``video``, ``leapp``, and ``torchrl`` are not "
"included; add them explicitly. See :ref:`installation-optional-extras` for "
"the complete list."
msgstr ""
"可选依赖组提供可用功能，任务选择器决定任务实际使用哪些功能。例如，``--extra ovphysx`` 安装 OV PhysX "
"集成，``physics=ovphysx`` 则让任务选择该后端。可以按需组合依赖组。``--extra all`` 安装经过筛选的 "
"``ov``、``rl-games``、``sb3``、``skrl``、``rsl-rl``、``rerun`` 和 ``viser``，但不包含 "
"Isaac Sim、独立导入器，以及 ``skrl-"
"jax``、``rlinf``、``mimic``、``teleop``、``tetrahedralization``、``video``、``leapp``、``torchrl``"
" 等专用依赖组，需要明确添加。完整列表见 :ref:`installation-optional-extras` 。"

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:95
msgid "Choose an RL library"
msgstr "选择强化学习库"

#: source/setup/quickstart.rst:97
msgid ""
"Pass ``--rl_library`` to ``train`` or ``play`` to choose the RL framework. "
"If you omit it, Isaac Lab uses the default registered for the task. Most "
"core tasks default to ``rsl_rl``, which is included in the standard ``uv "
"run`` environment and is a good starting point for GPU-based training."
msgstr ""
"在 ``train`` 或 ``play`` 命令中通过 ``--rl_library`` 选择强化学习框架。省略该参数时，Isaac Lab "
"使用任务注册的默认框架。大多数核心任务默认使用 ``rsl_rl`` ；它已包含在标准 ``uv run`` 环境中，适合作为 GPU 训练的入门选择。"

